; The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild: the brazier moved from the old west entrance to just inside the SOUTH gate the player now
; actually arrives through. The offset moved with it so the king still rises at the arena's centre,
; (0, 0, 0) — brazier (0, 0, 13) plus (0, 0, -13). Change one of these two and the boss spawns off
; centre with nothing logging it.
SpawnOffset = Vector3(0, 0, -13)


[node name="Model" parent="Brazier" instance=ExtResource("5_brazier")]

; --- 36D: the arena's declarative bindings ------------------------------------
; Four spawn points for a boss's add waves. They are found by GROUP, not by node path or name, so
; renaming or re-parenting one cannot silently unbind it — and BossController scopes the lookup to
; markers under its own parent, so a second loaded arena can never lend this one its spawns.
; The boss stands at the arena centre (the brazier's +14 X offset), so these ring him without
; dropping an add on top of him or inside a wall.

[node name="AddSpawns" type="Node3D" parent="."]

[node name="SpawnNE" type="Marker3D" parent="AddSpawns" groups=["boss_add_spawn"]]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 8, 0, 5)

[node name="SpawnNW" type="Marker3D" parent="AddSpawns" groups=["boss_add_spawn"]]
